{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1000_p", "source_sha256": "158a44aecdc95c732f175d8e08bfb334d6bf578cc40c75c500b48451c4850320", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』のPRのため、\n公演メンバーで情報番組に出演する事になった）", "zh": "（为了宣传『BATTLE OF THEATER』，公演成员要一起参加一档资讯节目了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1001_p", "source_sha256": "193fbb3d5b036289f7dff23e8a323ef8ad5e80933648a3d72264496e171a5473", "ja": "（他のメンバーは後から来る予定で、\n育が一番乗りしたんだけど……）", "zh": "（其他成员预计会晚些时候过来，育第一个到了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "38bbe93b53aa4aa9d2b2762c3997427f13e0c8eb09315337140219ebe848dbec", "ja": "今日のセットはこういうかんじなんだね。", "zh": "原来今天的布景是这种感觉呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "a68102bc597bbd8934a57559b97336a815802102e6bb19336c98c4e673c492bf", "ja": "いちばん奥のはしのところ、見えにくいだん差が\nあるから、みんなが来たらおしえてあげようっと。", "zh": "最里面边缘的地方有个不容易看清的高低差，\n等大家来了，我就去提醒她们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bc9951cbd5e48a00e3c1966299e0ab5956aaf11458e587fe3521cb32e4aa3a81", "ja": "すごいな、育。もうチェックもバッチリか。\n集合も一番だったし……。", "zh": "真厉害啊，育。已经检查得很到位了啊。集合也是第一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1005_p", "source_sha256": "877d98547aff210403c542e57973c10c11fc0de9070917b4e183c21e90438083", "ja": "（本来なら、こういうのも\nいい子ポイントをつける対象になりそうだが……）", "zh": "（按理说，这种表现也该算作获得好孩子积分的对象吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "12c82181f0e371faae0acfe9587bcf93cdad9b8df58461e0a53e9217f9756869", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\n今、いい子ポイントのこと考えたでしょ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n你刚才是在想乖孩子积分的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a05a12cc0fa1d6105a8f964779261dd3943003a6f3e31b2578bedf2d9067136", "ja": "これはちがうと思うよ。みんながわたしより\n遅くなっちゃうのは、学校とかの都合なんだし。", "zh": "我觉得这不一样哦。大家会比我晚到，都是因为学校之类的安排嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "275f6f02a2365a323c4e2f7dd349f7b3dc67e0e0cbd67779991028d6dd233985", "ja": "それにだん差をかくにんするのは、\nお仕事なんだからとうぜんだよ！　そうだよね？", "zh": "而且，确认高低差本来就是工作嘛！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d38b80bad707518b76e2b17e77e9fbbfd63ba9e6aa39ff9d49543a3225ab566f", "ja": "うん……そうだな、育。\n確かに、育の言うとおりだ。", "zh": "嗯……你说得对，育。\n确实正如育说的那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "2e8e5370ae13112eb770a7f01ffcf2ed62a27297178e34ee437e101262c25c51", "ja": "えへへ、でしょ？　だから今は一緒に、\nみんなのこと待ってよう？", "zh": "嘿嘿，对吧？所以现在就一起等大家，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "1ae463a56a61e4fd51794654d31657b456fa4b48658fe38748a0ec885724352a", "ja": "そうだ！　このあいだ伊織さんと作ったケーキ、\nおとうさんに食べてもらえたんだよ！", "zh": "对了！前段时间和伊织姐姐一起做的蛋糕，给爸爸吃到了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1012_p", "source_sha256": "64cdb100ea1debe37a58208baf62d7912511a9a7e93b39374e7e994c35a40c85", "ja": "おお、そうなのか！\nお父さん、何か言ってたか？", "zh": "哦，是吗！\n你爸爸说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "6f5367b026157650b12f62dcb269d41ee9da16d450e87b748e433e0942fe3270", "ja": "うん♪　朝起きたら、\nテーブルに手紙がおいてあったんだ。", "zh": "嗯♪早上起床后，发现桌上放着一封信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "2cc334fa19180e739ff220c0934f8378afe670f81acc5e7bba8e986b8d4d642e", "ja": "「ごちそうさま、育！　おいしかったよ、ありがとう」\nだって♪", "zh": "“谢谢款待，育！很好吃哦，谢谢你”\n这样写的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d7ac50eeb6b36db11151af9f73e536e237537f7e37fc7298fa0feb57811b6378", "ja": "おお……良かった。\n頑張って作った甲斐があったな。", "zh": "哦哦……太好了。\n这么努力做出来总算没白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "a6a630705f8960728168ef97ecc595679a566eeb12996ab78a7804510e4f8206", "ja": "うん。やっぱり、伝えてよかった。\n大好きとか、ありがとうとか……。", "zh": "嗯。果然，能传达给对方真是太好了。\n像是好喜欢你，还有谢谢你之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d4c8b72112f4c434d136b532a9de60f43332f44f337dc73b3ee52511a24a7a9", "ja": "わたし、思ったんだ。\nこれからもちゃんと伝えようって。", "zh": "我想过了。\n以后也要好好把心意表达出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "b17f195e66b0993f80d8c22733470c1673c8c73e79ef6a3527564bf503982cce", "ja": "もちろん\n{$P$}さんにもね！", "zh": "当然\n也会好好向{$P$}先生传达的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1019_p", "source_sha256": "344d62955ab6a594a66ad965421773197d07d0b8dc8cd5d419128231b81ce3bd", "ja": "ありがとう、育。\n俺からも、ちゃんと伝えるようにするよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，育。\n我也会好好传达给大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0613_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "b4b40f100bdf7ff8543a7e2174f3d8065635e52528e09c6c871267184ebb1916", "ja": "うん！　これからもよろしくね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嗯！今后也请多多关照，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
